cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: "Aedes Control: optimal scheduling of dengue vector control"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and adjoint-based optimal scheduling of Aedes aegypti vector
  control (larvicide, adulticide, breeding-site removal), driven by a
  temperature-dependent, non-Markovian model of the mosquito life cycle.
  Includes a desktop application and a browser planner that runs the same
  model locally.
